    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "気に入らないと　ツメを　立てるが\nたまに　のどを　鳴らして\n甘える　性格が　一部に　大人気だ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Araña cuando está enfadado y ronronea cuando está\ncariñoso. Su imprevisibilidad es famosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ごきげんな　ニャルマーは　しっぽで\nしんたいそうの　リボンの　ような\nうつくしい　うごきを　みせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "기분이 좋은 나옹마는 꼬리로\n리듬 체조의 리본처럼\n아름다운 움직임을 보인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il est heureux, sa queue décrit des arabesques\ncomme un ruban de gymnastique rythmique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Je nach Laune lässt es seinen Schweif anmutig\nwirbeln, ganz wie das Band eines Sportgymnasten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dependiendo de su humor, mueve grácilmente su\ncola, que se asemeja a un lazo de gimnasia rítmica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
